    "name": "ServeRest API - Complete Test Suite",
    "description": "Comprehensive API test collection for ServeRest (https://serverest.dev/)\n\nThis collection covers 100% of the Users API endpoints with:\n- JWT Authentication\n- Rate limiting awareness (100 req/min)\n- Positive and negative test scenarios\n- Data validation tests\n\nAuthor: Automated Test Suite\nDate: April 2026",
